                        "form": "кла́ксо́нами"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c9caac8d-3fee-4331-83fe-7aa19ca5f07f",
                        "entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "кла́ксо́не"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "7a8a7228-8e1e-480e-900f-6fa595c88097",
                        "entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "кла́ксо́нах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f048f653-db3c-3d8a-b482-d21b693d0744",
                        "entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "автомоб. устройство для подачи звукового сигнала, предупреждающего о приближении автомобиля"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37d2f8e2-8b18-401d-81fd-3a3c649eff5c",
                                "sense_id": "f048f653-db3c-3d8a-b482-d21b693d0744",
                                "text": "Наконец, на стоянку вкатилась целая кавалькада, четыре машины. Захлопали дверцы, требовательно заревел клаксон."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "207320cf-5cbe-4c60-ad04-e3ddedf588ed",
                                "sense_id": "f048f653-db3c-3d8a-b482-d21b693d0744",
                                "text": "Если показывались признаки населённого пункта, дежурный длинными гудками клаксона объявлял тревогу."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4791bdb2-e7b3-360f-b6d7-8a3762470982",
                        "entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. управляющий механизм, приводящий в действие клаксон [1]"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "533d78bc-30fd-45df-a898-15049e1cd554",
                                "sense_id": "4791bdb2-e7b3-360f-b6d7-8a3762470982",
                                "text": "Мы остановились у ворот, шофёр нажал на клаксон."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "316f4891-89c4-4c8b-93c8-724e99509734",
                                "sense_id": "4791bdb2-e7b3-360f-b6d7-8a3762470982",
                                "text": "С трудом дотянувшись до руля, капитан дважды нажал на клаксон."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d083b2a7-1e0c-3651-8955-ef76ede8d2ec",
                        "entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. звуковой сигнал, издаваемый клаксоном [1]"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "74694676-4aa9-4cfa-ad6d-1c58ee11ac7d",
                                "sense_id": "d083b2a7-1e0c-3651-8955-ef76ede8d2ec",
                                "text": "Резкий протяжный клаксон заставил его вздрогнуть."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "314cb40e-ec5b-4269-bc43-352d715e1972",
                                "sense_id": "d083b2a7-1e0c-3651-8955-ef76ede8d2ec",
                                "text": "Без глушителей, издавая целый спектр непереносимых звуков, включая гудки, звонки и клаксоны, двигались мотороллеры, грузовики, автобусы и моторикши."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "922c9aa0-a37a-4d28-bfc7-1182b5fa1aef",
                        "source_entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "source_sense_description": "устройство",
                        "target_lang_word": "klaxon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "klaxon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                        "entry_id": "49ed1309-f521-3ed3-b0a9-c5ff34b818b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A loud electric alarm or horn, especially as used in automobiles in the early 20th century."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6990b9d-eab4-4be4-a363-c0b11c76dccc",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "And she went so swiftly that he could only follow her to the door. The large shape of the car swallowed her up; and the car twisted softly around the little drive and away to the London road. Minutes later he heard its Klaxon, just one sharp keen, like the harsh cry of a sea-bird. …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d63097c2-828a-45a2-84dd-519a420cb0d5",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "There was a motor car behind them now and it blasted into the truck noise and the dust with its klaxon again and again; then flashed on lights that showed the dust like a solid yellow cloud and surged past them in a whining rise of gears and a demanding, threatening, bludgeoning of klaxoning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0373650-984c-43d5-ae3d-1eec75cf6c8d",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "They could hear a lot more than they could see. But what they heard told them exactly nothing. There were the klaxons, which kept up their long, monotonous, insane growling protest all through the raid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "511a11d9-2bc9-420e-b580-49388c004e9b",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "When the claxon sounded they immediately stopped what they were doing and uncovered the Oerlikon. Paddy, who was ammunition feeder, stood by while Jock trained the 20mm gun around."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ebe0ef2-e9a7-459d-b1f9-d5cb9c858584",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "Irenka was up front using the lavatory when the lights in the cabin went red and the klaxon sounded over the speakers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "klaxon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66fac1a5-ba24-3e44-94f3-f3123a5df29d",
                                        "entry_id": "a94c98aa-c7ce-3f51-be13-e2590aca310e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To produce a loud, siren-like wail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83b069e7-d41b-47ce-b7fc-a06d5e016967",
                                                "sense_id": "66fac1a5-ba24-3e44-94f3-f3123a5df29d",
                                                "text": "He headed down the Embankment. It was noon precisely. Big Ben klaxoned the hour with blasts of servo whistle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6219091e-6e8f-4b09-a01c-f975c52f40e1",
                                                "sense_id": "66fac1a5-ba24-3e44-94f3-f3123a5df29d",
                                                "text": "Suffering. It was like a great discordant symphony ringing out from the world; like a klaxoning of a million million cracked bells."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ad58063-f75f-4517-84d9-52eeeac54d19",
                                                "sense_id": "66fac1a5-ba24-3e44-94f3-f3123a5df29d",
                                                "text": "Century stops before an eel-ship, coiled in jewel-skinned splendor. Its great eye-ports are open, and Century signals with a hand; the eel extends a proboscis lined with diamond mesh and graphene plates like a ramp. Century leads Mere into the eel's body. Alarms klaxon in Mere's head—its escape is known."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bcc1176a-9102-439b-844e-675930446f46",
                        "source_entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "source_sense_description": "устройство",
                        "target_lang_word": "klakson",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "klakson",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "440f916d-2394-3686-9e3a-b6f4ea24534d",
                                        "entry_id": "49cacf8c-5460-363a-ba20-be3cbdbed9c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "urządzenie służące do wydawania sygnałów dźwiękowych (najczęściej w celu ostrzeżenia)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54947aed-5402-4ce3-a288-e39bc26da6ea",
                                                "sense_id": "440f916d-2394-3686-9e3a-b6f4ea24534d",
                                                "text": "Jazda samochodem z uszkodzonym klaksonem jest niedozwolona."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "439dd6ce-e279-4341-85f2-013e5faf2044",
                        "source_entry_id": "b0568980-5f72-35be-9fbb-8b863e4beab4",
                        "source_sense_description": "управляющий о́рган",
                        "target_lang_word": "klaxon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "klaxon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                        "entry_id": "49ed1309-f521-3ed3-b0a9-c5ff34b818b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A loud electric alarm or horn, especially as used in automobiles in the early 20th century."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6990b9d-eab4-4be4-a363-c0b11c76dccc",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "And she went so swiftly that he could only follow her to the door. The large shape of the car swallowed her up; and the car twisted softly around the little drive and away to the London road. Minutes later he heard its Klaxon, just one sharp keen, like the harsh cry of a sea-bird. …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d63097c2-828a-45a2-84dd-519a420cb0d5",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "There was a motor car behind them now and it blasted into the truck noise and the dust with its klaxon again and again; then flashed on lights that showed the dust like a solid yellow cloud and surged past them in a whining rise of gears and a demanding, threatening, bludgeoning of klaxoning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0373650-984c-43d5-ae3d-1eec75cf6c8d",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "They could hear a lot more than they could see. But what they heard told them exactly nothing. There were the klaxons, which kept up their long, monotonous, insane growling protest all through the raid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "511a11d9-2bc9-420e-b580-49388c004e9b",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "When the claxon sounded they immediately stopped what they were doing and uncovered the Oerlikon. Paddy, who was ammunition feeder, stood by while Jock trained the 20mm gun around."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ebe0ef2-e9a7-459d-b1f9-d5cb9c858584",
                                                "sense_id": "62868e11-a618-3410-9880-be44d7bb50a9",
                                                "text": "Irenka was up front using the lavatory when the lights in the cabin went red and the klaxon sounded over the speakers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
